    "chunk_text": "Wi\u00f0 sina sare & wi\u00f0 geswel genim \u00fea ylcan wyrte artemesiam, cnuca hy mid ele wel gewylde, lege Hyt h\u00e6l\u00f0 wundorlice. Gyf hwa mid fotadle swy\u00fee & hefelice geswenced sy, \u00feonne genim \u00f0u \u00feysse ylcan wyrte wyrtwalan, & eftsona he bi\u00f0 geh\u00e6led & acl\u00e6nsod swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u ne wenst \u00fe\u00e6t heo m\u00e6ge swa mycel m\u00e6gen habban. Gyf hwa sy mid feferum gedreht genime \u00feonne \u00f0ysse ylcan wyrte seaw mid ele & smyre hyt. Sona heo \u00feone fefer fram ade\u00fe. Mugwyrt. \u00d0eos \u00feridde wyrt \u00fee we artemesiam leptefilos & o\u00f0rum naman mucgwyrt nemdon, heo bi\u00f0 cenned Gyf \u00f0u hyre blos\u00f0man brytest he h\u00e6f\u00f0 sw\u00e6c swylce ellen. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s magan sare genim \u00feas wyrte & cnuca hy & gewyll hy wel mid amigdales ele \u00feam gemete \u00f0e Binnan fif dagum he bi\u00f0 hal. & gif \u00feysse wyrte wyrttruma by\u00f0 ahangen ofer hwylces huses duru, \u00feonne ne m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man \u00feam Wi\u00f0 \u00feara sina bifunge genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte seaw gemencged mid ele, smyre hy \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6rmid. Hy geswica\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re bifunge & hyt ealne \u00f0one leahtor genime\u00f0. Witodlice \u00feas \u00fereo wyrta \u00fee we artemesias nemdon ys s\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t Diana hy findan scolde & heora & he \u00feas wyrta of naman \u00f0\u00e6re Dianan, \u00fe\u00e6t is artemesias genemnede. Docc\u00e6. \u00d0",
